+/*
+ * Adaptive root-port speed (ESP32-S31 port, 2026-09-04). See params.c.
+ *
+ * Switching is a bus event: FSLSSupp can only take effect through a port
+ * reset, so the port is powered down for 200 ms and back up. The core
+ * reports a disconnect, the USB core tears the tree down, and the hub
+ * comes back at the new speed - 12 Mbit/s with FSLSSupp set, in which
+ * case no device behind it needs a split any more.
